# Build context for the Ferrowarden image (the root Dockerfile).
#
# Allow-list: send the Docker daemon only what the Dockerfile copies. Above
# all this keeps secrets/, .env*, certs/ and the git history out of the build
# context, so they can never reach a build cache or an image layer by mistake.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src
!templates
!docs/openapi.yaml
